  "caveats": [
    "Weather and load forecasts are archived versions retrieved in October 2026, not the vintages available at each past cutoff; their published schedules (ECMWF 00 UTC run of D-1, load forecast due 10:00 on D-1) are the availability evidence.",
    "Models train on native quarter-hour data only, so training windows are at most about six months at the start of the selection window.",
    "The selection window includes the native holdout consulted once on 2026-10-17 for ridge-core-180-v1; no setting here was chosen on it.",
    "Chronos-2 is used zero-shot with pinned weights; it was released before these windows, so they cannot be part of its training data.",
    "No winter days are evaluated."
  ]
